<title>JAPAN: Kanto Auto Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanto Auto Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		137.73		vs	  154.52</p>
<p> Operating	    1.34		vs	    2.40</p>
<p> Current	    583    million    vs	  980    million</p>
<p> Net		  412    million    vs	  564    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.91 yen	  vs	    8.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     70 million	  vs	  70 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanto Auto Works Ltd is an assembler of Toyota Motor Corp&quot;s compact cars for the domestic market.</p>
